<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A clear path into working with Arrington Consultancy: what is on offer, what each thing costs, and what happens next. Start with a free conversation, or begin with a defined piece of work.">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/where-to-start">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta property="og:description" content="A clear path into working with Arrington Consultancy: what is on offer, what each thing costs, and what happens next.">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/where-to-start">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/img/logo">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="A clear path into working with Arrington Consultancy: what is on offer, what each thing costs, and what happens next.">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/img/logo">
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-32.png" type="image/png" sizes="32x32">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-16.png" type="image/png" sizes="16x16">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=AW-18129914078"></script>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
        gtag('js', new Date());
        gtag('config', 'AW-18129914078');
        <% if (ga4Id) { %>
        gtag('config', '<%= ga4Id %>');
        <% } %>
    </script>
    <style nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        :root {
            <% for (const [prop, val] of Object.entries(theme.vars)) { %>
            <%= prop %>: <%= val %>;
            <% } %>
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        <%- include('partials/site-chrome-styles') %>

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            line-height: 1.22;
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
        }
        p { color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 1.2rem; }

        .wts-label {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.9rem;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .btn-primary:hover, .btn-primary:focus-visible { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text-bright); border-color: var(--border); }
        .btn-outline:hover, .btn-outline:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

        /* Intro */
        .wts-intro {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 8.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .wts-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 2.9rem); }
        .wts-intro p { font-size: 1.08rem; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-muted); }

        main { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem; }

        /* Vertical offer sections — deliberately not cards: no shared box
           background, no border box, no side-by-side columns. A thin top
           divider and generous vertical space are the only structure. */
        .wts-offer {
            padding: 3.25rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .wts-offer:first-child { border-top: none; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
        .wts-offer-eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }
        .wts-offer h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .wts-offer-price {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .wts-offer p.wts-offer-body { font-size: 1.02rem; max-width: 600px; }
        .wts-offer-actions { margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }

        /* Website Build sits visually apart — a different kind of
           engagement from the two advisory offers above it. */
        .wts-offer--build { background: var(--black-soft, rgba(255,255,255,0.02)); margin: 0 -1.5rem; padding: 3.25rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; }

        .wts-closing {
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 3.5rem 0 1rem;
        }
        .wts-closing p { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/site-header', { currentPage: { slug: 'where-to-start' }, navPages, canEdit: false, content, pageContact }) %>

    <div class="wts-intro">
        <p class="wts-label">Where to Start</p>
        <h1>Choose the right place to begin.</h1>
        <p>Every business is different, and not every business needs the same amount of attention. Here is what is actually on offer, what it costs, and what happens after you start.</p>
    </div>

    <main>
        <section class="wts-offer" id="conversation-offer">
            <p class="wts-offer-eyebrow">Not sure where to start?</p>
            <h2>30 Minute Conversation</h2>
            <p class="wts-offer-price">£0</p>
            <p class="wts-offer-body">A straightforward conversation about what is going on in the business. No presentation, no pitch. If it is worth taking further, we will say so, and if it is not, we will say that too.</p>
            <div class="wts-offer-actions">
                <a href="#conversation" class="btn btn-primary">Start the conversation</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="wts-offer" id="commercial-review-offer">
            <p class="wts-offer-eyebrow">One thing you want looked at properly?</p>
            <h2><%= offers.commercial_review.name %></h2>
            <p class="wts-offer-price">£<%= (offers.commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
            <p class="wts-offer-body"><%= offers.commercial_review.description %> The value is Tom's judgement and assessment, not minutes purchased. If you go on to the Full Commercial Review, the full amount is credited against it.</p>
            <div class="wts-offer-actions">
                <a href="/where-to-start/commercial-review" class="btn btn-outline">See the Commercial Review</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="wts-offer" id="full-review-offer">
            <p class="wts-offer-eyebrow">A proper look at the business?</p>
            <h2><%= offers.full_commercial_review.name %></h2>
            <p class="wts-offer-price">£<%= (offers.full_commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
            <p class="wts-offer-body"><%= offers.full_commercial_review.description %></p>
            <div class="wts-offer-actions">
                <a href="/where-to-start/full-commercial-review" class="btn btn-outline">See the Full Commercial Review</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="wts-offer wts-offer--build" id="website-build-offer">
            <p class="wts-offer-eyebrow">Need something built?</p>
            <h2>Website Build</h2>
            <p class="wts-offer-price">From £999</p>
            <p class="wts-offer-body">A genuinely bespoke website, built properly rather than assembled from a template. A different kind of engagement from the two reviews above: this is build work, not diagnosis.</p>
            <div class="wts-offer-actions">
                <a href="/websites-and-ai" class="btn btn-outline">See the website offer</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="wts-offer" id="something-else-offer">
            <p class="wts-offer-eyebrow">Something else?</p>
            <h2>Tell us what you need</h2>
            <p class="wts-offer-body">If none of the above quite fits, say what is going on and we will tell you honestly whether we can help, and what that would look like.</p>
            <div class="wts-offer-actions">
                <a href="#conversation" class="btn btn-outline">Tell us what you need</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="wts-closing">
            <p>Every route above ends with the same person doing the work. There is no team it gets handed off to.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/site-footer', { canEdit: false, pageContact, content }) %>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        <%- include('partials/site-chrome-script') %>
    </script>
</body>
</html>
